idmp-spor:SPOR-PharmaceuticalDoseForm-100000073665
    a
        owl:NamedIndividual ,
        idmp-mprd:PharmaceuticalDoseForm ,
        idmp-spor:SPORControlledVocabularyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "Film-coated tablet"@en ;
    skos:definition "Solid single-dose preparation consisting of a tablet coated with a thin polymeric film that dissolves within a few minutes in the gastrointestinal fluid. Film-coated tablets are intended for oral use to release active substance(s) at a rate which is not significantly delayed compared to that of the uncoated tablet."@en ;
    cmns-cxtdsg:isApplicableIn idmp-eurga:RegulatoryContext-EuropeanMedicinesAgencyGeneral ;
.

idmp-spor:SPOR-PharmaceuticalDoseForm-100000073859
    a
        owl:NamedIndividual ,
        idmp-mprd:PharmaceuticalDoseForm ,
        idmp-spor:SPORControlledVocabularyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "Powder for solution for infusion"@en ;
    skos:definition
        "Solid sterile preparation consisting of one or more powders, including freeze-dried powders, intended to be dissolved in the specified aqueous liquid to obtain a solution for infusion."@en ,
        "Preparato sterile solido costituito da una o più polveri, comprese le polveri liofilizzate, destinate ad essere sciolte nel liquido acquoso specificato per ottenere una soluzione per infusione."@it ;
    cmns-cxtdsg:isApplicableIn idmp-eurga:RegulatoryContext-EuropeanMedicinesAgencyGeneral ;
.

idmp-spor:SPOR-PharmaceuticalDoseForm-100000073863
    a
        owl:NamedIndividual ,
        idmp-mprd:PharmaceuticalDoseForm ,
        idmp-spor:SPORControlledVocabularyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "Solution for injection"@en ;
    skos:definition "Liquid sterile single-dose or multidose preparation consisting of a solution intended for administration by injection."@en ;
    cmns-cxtdsg:isApplicableIn idmp-eurga:RegulatoryContext-EuropeanMedicinesAgencyGeneral ;
.

idmp-spor:SPOR-PharmaceuticalDoseForm-100000074038
    a
        owl:NamedIndividual ,
        idmp-mprd:PharmaceuticalDoseForm ,
        idmp-spor:SPORControlledVocabularyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "Solution for injection/infusion"@en ;
    skos:definition
        "Liquid sterile single-dose or multidose preparation consisting of a solution intended for administration by injection or infusion."@en ,
        "Preparato liquido sterile monodose o multidose costituito da una soluzione destinata alla somministrazione per iniezione o infusione."@it ;
    cmns-cxtdsg:isApplicableIn idmp-eurga:RegulatoryContext-EuropeanMedicinesAgencyGeneral ;
.

idmp-spor:SPOR-PharmaceuticalDoseForm-100000074070
    a
        owl:NamedIndividual ,
        idmp-mprd:PharmaceuticalDoseForm ,
        idmp-spor:SPORControlledVocabularyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "Inhalation solution"@en ;
    skos:definition "Liquid, usually multidose preparation consisting of a solution intended for inhalation use. The preparation is presented in a non-pressurized container fitted with a metering dose mechanism. 'Nebuliser solution' and 'Pressurised inhalation, solution' are excluded."@en ;
    cmns-cxtdsg:isApplicableIn idmp-eurga:RegulatoryContext-EuropeanMedicinesAgencyGeneral ;
.

